{"currentMessages":[{"content":"开始本次 Recommendation 执行。","role":"user","timestamp":1788854400000},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"arguments":{"plan":[{"status":"in_progress","step":"Analyze the interest and candidate pool to select 20 relevant candidates"},{"status":"pending","step":"Publish the ordered recommendation collection"}]},"id":"call_00_rEQNllDr8frvlXKlidly8353","name":"update_plan","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","rawStopReason":"tool_calls","responseId":"9f605d44-99c0-421c-be36-cecd1457af37","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788852043372,"usage":{"cacheRead":1280,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0,"output":0,"total":0},"input":27973,"output":88,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":29341}},{"content":[{"text":"Plan updated","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1788852044987,"toolCallId":"call_00_rEQNllDr8frvlXKlidly8353","toolName":"update_plan"},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"Let me analyze the task. The interest is \"阳台园艺\" (balcony gardening), focused on home plant care, planting methods, and growth principles. Importantly, the user explicitly does NOT care about flower shop operations or courtyard engineering quotes.\n\nThe candidates are all tagged with the garden interest. However, I need to look at the content types. Some candidates are \"市场观察\" (market observation) which discusses flower shop pricing, commercial landscape engineering quotes, and nursery wholesale channels — these are exactly what the user explicitly does NOT want.\n\nLet me identify the content types from the candidates:\n- \"操作记录\" (operation records) - relevant, hands-on care\n- \"概念速览\" (concept overview) - relevant\n- \"条件与原理\" (conditions and principles) - relevant\n- \"专题观察\" (special topic observation) - about plant naming history, garden aesthetics, exhibitions, paintings, literature - these are somewhat tangential but not about flower shop operations\n- \"市场观察\" (market observation) - about flower shop pricing, commercial landscape quotes, nursery wholesale - NOT relevant per explicit user preference\n\nThe user's interest explicitly excludes \"花店经营或庭院工程报价\" (flower shop operations or courtyard engineering quotes). The \"市场观察\" content type directly discusses these excluded topics. So I should avoid those.\n\nLet me count the candidates and identify which are market observation type. Let me scan through the candidates for \"市场观察\" in title/description.\n\nMarket observation candidates (to exclude):\n- item-18b36293621a 月季光照：半阴窗台中的市场观察\n- item-1de472d5c51f 盆栽越冬：朝南阳台中的市场观察\n- item-2008d7b27ed9 盆栽越冬：通风露台中的市场观察\n- item-327ab77da510 盆土透气：朝南阳台中的市场观察\n- item-363059bb3cc7 番茄育苗：通风露台中的市场观察\n- item-4425b4436dc2 薄荷修剪：朝南阳台中的市场观察\n- item-53294f157aec 多肉浇水：半阴窗台中的市场观察\n- item-53f94c4f082a 蓝莓基质：半阴窗台中的市场观察\n- item-545936ea40c6 草莓授粉：半阴窗台中的市场观察\n- item-584d4349511e 月季光照：夏季室内中的市场观察\n- item-5e7665c76538 薄荷修剪：半阴窗台中的市场观察\n\nThese market observation items discuss flower shop pricing, commercial landscape engineering quotes, nursery wholesale channels — exactly what the user explicitly does not want. I should exclude these.\n\nThe working set has 80 candidates exposed. I need to select 20. Let me consider the relevant content types: 操作记录, 概念速览, 条件与原理, 专题观察.\n\nThe \"专题观察\" type discusses plant naming history, garden aesthetic schools, city exhibitions, paintings, literary imagery, local culture. This is somewhat tangential to the user's interest in plant care, planting methods, and growth principles. It's not about flower shop operations though. It's more cultural/historical. Given the user's focus on practical care and growth principles, I'd prefer the operation records, concept overviews, and conditions/principles articles.\n\nLet me focus on the most relevant content types: 操作记录 (hands-on care records), 条件与原理 (conditions and principles), and 概念速览 (concept overviews). These directly relate to plant care, planting methods, and growth principles.\n\nLet me select 20 candidates from these relevant types, balancing across topics (草莓授粉, 盆土透气, 香草扦插, 蓝莓基质, 薄荷修剪, 盆栽越冬, 番茄育苗, 月季光照, 多肉浇水, 黄叶排查) and environments (半阴窗台, 朝南阳台, 通风露台, 夏季室内).\n\nLet me pick a diverse set of 20. I'll prioritize 操作记录 and 条件与原理 (most practical and principle-focused), plus some 概念速览.\n\nLet me list the relevant candidates (excluding market observation):\n\nOperation records (操作记录):\n- item-002280b87be1 草莓授粉：半阴窗台\n- item-0203081e5c85 薄荷修剪：通风露台\n- item-02270edcb008 香草扦插：通风露台\n- item-02afa433233c 蓝莓基质：朝南阳台\n- item-055c41141fa3 盆土透气：通风露台\n- item-096aa2f3c184 多肉浇水：夏季室内\n- item-13c3e3ea6eff 月季光照：半阴窗台\n- item-160347be1b39 香草扦插：朝南阳台\n- item-1686447be4ae 番茄育苗：通风露台\n- item-26e02f642b93 盆栽越冬：朝南阳台\n- item-28a8d8a64d46 多肉浇水：朝南阳台\n- item-309258e8bc8e 番茄育苗：朝南阳台\n- item-3388cf0e679b 盆土透气：夏季室内\n- item-33e034f08c2b 黄叶排查：通风露台\n- item-37c032bcc847 黄叶排查：夏季室内\n- item-426fe311e003 盆栽越冬：通风露台\n- item-4b9d0781f27e 薄荷修剪：夏季室内\n- item-52be0a87a495 香草扦插：半阴窗台\n- item-5da6b295e272 草莓授粉：朝南阳台\n\nConditions and principles (条件与原理):\n- item-04bde6ad0003 盆土透气：夏季室内\n- item-0ee7c59bda70 多肉浇水：半阴窗台\n- item-12ade2b2e5e1 月季光照：通风露台\n- item-1413b31a8254 多肉浇水：夏季室内\n- item-173080c8a696 黄叶排查：半阴窗台\n- item-1cb3d12a82fc 盆栽越冬：通风露台\n- item-22359398a920 薄荷修剪：夏季室内\n- item-3faf9f095870 盆土透气：通风露台\n- item-418ab8f70803 月季光照：夏季室内\n- item-44d2953a9dd1 薄荷修剪：朝南阳台\n- item-45fb6da94e7d 蓝莓基质：半阴窗台\n- item-463f0047433f 薄荷修剪：半阴窗台\n- item-4e425694d9db 草莓授粉：通风露台\n- item-52c619201ab3 黄叶排查：通风露台\n- item-53be14d6d282 番茄育苗：通风露台\n\nConcept overviews (概念速览):\n- item-00c0cea6b0c6 盆土透气：夏季室内\n- item-013fccf40557 香草扦插：朝南阳台\n- item-015275c63e27 蓝莓基质：通风露台\n- item-025b955e2312 盆栽越冬：通风露台\n- item-04c217827669 番茄育苗：朝南阳台\n- item-0b2671963ef3 蓝莓基质：半阴窗台\n- item-0ee4229d4c27 香草扦插：夏季室内\n- item-103a7d29702e 番茄育苗：夏季室内\n- item-1325bfab77b8 草莓授粉：夏季室内\n- item-15afc24e68b9 多肉浇水：半阴窗台\n- item-1b0dc8fac7fb 盆土透气：通风露台\n- item-2475328e0c7e 薄荷修剪：夏季室内\n- item-3739247177a3 盆土透气：朝南阳台\n- item-385e78f94655 月季光照：通风露台\n- item-46b95565389